  "introTitle": "Paransori",
  "introTagline": "Adding clarity to your everyday.",
  "introQuestion": "If sound had a color,\nwhat would it be?",
  "introPoem": "Clear as a blue sky,\nfresh as a cool breeze,\ncalm as a gentle sea.",
  "introStarted": "Paransori began with the wish to capture sounds like these.",
  "introNameLabel": "About the name",
  "introNameStory": "Paransori comes from two Korean words, 'paran' and 'sori'. 'Paran' means blue, bringing to mind clear skies and the deep blue sea. 'Sori' means sound. The name carries our wish to share, through sound, the freshness of a clear sky, the coolness of a gentle breeze, and the comfort we feel in nature.",
  "introEverydayTitle": "Sound in your everyday",
  "introMoments": "When you need a short break in a busy day,\nwhen a favorite song comes to mind,\nwhen you want to discover a new radio station,\nwhen you want a quiet moment with the sounds of nature.",
  "introEveryday1": "Paransori hopes to be there, lightly, in all the different moments of your day.",
  "introEveryday2": "A single song, a familiar radio show, the soft patter of rain — any of these can make an ordinary day a little brighter. That's why we're building a space that's simple, easy and enjoyable for everyone.",
  "introSoundsTitle": "Sounds you'll find in Paransori",
  "introWishTitle": "What Paransori hopes to share",
  "introWish1": "Time spent listening to the sounds you love is closer than you think — as your morning begins, while you work, and on quiet nights as the day winds down.",
  "introWish2": "Paransori began in Korea and now joins people all around the world. We hope it adds a little joy and ease to each of your days.",
  "introClosing1": "A space for sound you can turn to anytime, anywhere.",
  "introClosing2": "So your day can be a little clearer.",
  "introSign": "Paransori.",
  "introVersion": "Version",
  "introFeature1Title": "Your music",
  "introFeature1Desc": "Relax with the music saved on your phone and fill your time with the songs you love.",
